    [*] --> dispatch
    dispatch --> cloudRendering : Cloud render
    dispatch --> awaitingDevice : Phone render
    dispatch --> failedCard : Start refused

    cloudRendering --> ready : All versions done
    cloudRendering --> cloudPartial : Some versions failed
    cloudPartial --> ready : Watch the good ones
    cloudRendering --> failedCard : Render failed

    awaitingDevice --> phonePreparing : iPhone picks up the job
    awaitingDevice --> quietWait : Status read failed
    quietWait --> awaitingDevice : Re-read on its own
    awaitingDevice --> phoneWait : Too hot or too full to start
    phoneWait --> awaitingDevice : Cooled down or space freed
    awaitingDevice --> needsChange : iPhone can't render this recipe, server told
    awaitingDevice --> needsUpdate : Recipe newer than this Kria, server told
    awaitingDevice --> superseded : Newer edit approved
    awaitingDevice --> autoResume : Server gave up after a day, you reopen
    autoResume --> awaitingDevice : New attempt, same edit
    phonePreparing --> phoneRendering : Footage ready
    phonePreparing --> originalMissing : An original isn't on this iPhone
    phoneRendering --> localReady : Export finished
    phoneRendering --> needsAttention : Export failed
    phonePreparing --> paused : Tap Stop rendering
    phoneRendering --> paused : Tap Stop rendering
    paused --> awaitingDevice : Tap Resume (same attempt)
    localReady --> syncing : Upload starts
    syncing --> synced : Upload accepted
    syncing --> localReady : Upload blip, retries without rendering
    synced --> ready
    needsAttention --> awaitingDevice : Tap Try again (new attempt)
    originalMissing --> awaitingDevice : Originals found, finishes on its own
    needsChange --> chatChange : Tap Review the updated edit
    chatChange --> awaitingDevice : New version for this iPhone
    needsUpdate --> autoResume : Update Kria and reopen

    failedCard --> retryApproval : Retry approved edit
    failedCard --> refreshLoop : No retry id, tap Refresh
    refreshLoop --> refreshLoop : Tap Refresh again
    refreshLoop --> [*] : Type a new message
    failedCard --> nonRetryable : Phone gate refusal
    nonRetryable --> [*] : New chat
    retryApproval --> cloudRendering : Re-runs the approved program
    ready --> [*]

